== 3. What a weaker policy lets through: Kyverno's controllers exempt from disallow-latest-tag, against the revisions ConfigHub recorded as failing
$ cub sveltos impact --sandbox-kubeconfig sandbox.kubeconfig --corpus mer-kyverno-base --policy policies/replica-limits.yaml --policy policies/disallow-latest-tag.yaml --candidate policies/candidates/disallow-latest-tag-exempt-kyverno.yaml
