mer-kyverno-base/kyverno@8         kyverno@8 (recorded as failing)  Deployment kyverno-cleanup-controller  denied  allowed  newly allowed  disallow-latest-tag (binding disallow-latest-tag): Using a mutable image tag such as 'latest' is not allowed.

